  "question": {
    "text": "If the curve satisfying differential equation <math><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the equation of the curve is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given equation is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />or <math><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math><br />As it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> The equation of curve is <math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math>"
  }
